  data: {
    LLM: "Bet on the Banker. Even with the 5% commission, it has a lower house edge (1.06%) compared to the Player bet (1.24%).\n\nDo not bet on the Tie. The Tie bet has a house edge of over 14%, which is mathematically disastrous over time.\n\nDisregard 'Roadmaps' (patterns). While many players look for 'streaks' in scorecards (Big Eye Boy, Small Road), each hand is an independent event with nearly fixed odds.",
